# Public base URL of the deployed site.
# Used for canonical URLs, Open Graph images, sitemap.xml and robots.txt.
#
# Local development: leave unset (falls back to http://localhost:3000).
# Vercel production: set to your real domain, e.g. https://shahzaib.dev
#
# This is the ONLY environment variable the site uses, and it is public by
# design. Never put a secret in a NEXT_PUBLIC_* variable.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=
